# Build context is the repository root (beacon/Dockerfile depends on packages/ui). Keep host
# artefacts and secrets out of the image; the stages install and build from scratch.
**/node_modules
**/.next
**/dist
**/.astro
**/data
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example
.git
.github
.idea
.claude
docs
landing
wardend
deploy
**/*.md
